# Differential cases (ADR-0020) of #114 "PLAIN calls over the inline cap and past the IR depth" (ADR-0040
# "Amendment (ticket #114)", F-54): a call whose expansion would pass the inline cap or MAX_IR_DEPTH, or would be
# the 512th nested expansion, is a PLAIN Call to a lifted function, so each filter here, a Stub before #114, runs
# as jq-ref runs it. Every case is required at #114 (oracle/src/test/resources/require/114.txt). Format:
# oracle/src/main/java/io/github/subapavel/jqj/oracle/diff/DiffCase.java. Expected outputs live in over-cap.rec,
# written by scripts/oracle-record.sh only. Ids are immutable.

# The nesting trigger: a flat chain of 600 definitions adds no level, so only the 512th nested expansion lifts.

